# Bean Stalker does not use a root .env file. Each app owns its own:
#
#   apps/api/.env.example   →  copy to  apps/api/.env        (server; holds the one secret)
#   apps/web/.env.example   →  copy to  apps/web/.env.local  (browser; public config only)
#
# Full variable inventory + classification: docs/13_OPERATIONS/Environment Contract.md
# Never put real credentials in any tracked file.
